     First, to set the record straight, I was apparently misunderstood
when I discussed reading scrolls while confused.  There are three
scrolls that are potentially dangerous by this method.  In order of
danger, they are genocide (kills you outright), create monster (creates
about ten monsters; okay if you can teleport), and teleport (leaves you
on a random dlvl).  Some positive scrolls may be nullified (identify);
some may be enhanced (the enchant scrolls both rustproof their targets,
and the detect gold scroll will, if I remember right, detect traps) and
some negative scrolls are mitigated (destroy armor, punishment).
